<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43863" root="&#xA;                        نحو&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَحَا نَحْوَهُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He went towards,</i> or <i>in the
direction of, him</i> or <i>it.</i> (Msb, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also,
<i>He pursued his</i> (another's) <i>course, doing as he
did;</i> or <i>purposed his purpose.</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَرَضَ عَرْضَهُ</span>,
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَدَا شَدْوَهُ</span>; and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصْدَهُ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَحَاهُ</span>, inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَحْوٌ</span>, signifies [also] <i>He purposed it,</i> or <i>intended
it.</i> (MA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَحَوْتُ جِلْدَ البَعِيرِ</span>, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنْحَيَتُهُ</span></b> ,
<i>I stripped off the skin of the camel.</i> (Msb,
voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلَخَ</span>). See 4.

